# Line endings are part of the repo, not of each machine's git config.
# Text is stored and checked out LF everywhere; binaries are never touched.
# The explicit binary rules exist because auto-detection fails: git has
# classified a real PDF as text and corrupted every checkout of it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip  binary
